<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>{{.Year}} · {{.Recipient}} · Annual sponsor report</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/sponsor-report.css?v=recipient-logo1"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/sponsor-report-paper.css?v=20261023-demand"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/sponsor-report-annual.css?v=20261023-recipient-logo"><script src="/static/js/sponsor-report.js?v=recipient-logo1" defer></script></head>
<body data-layout="paper" data-readonly="{{.Preview}}" class="annual-report">
{{if .Preview}}<div class="synthetic-banner">LOCAL LAYOUT DEMO · Illustrative event metrics, not actual annual results</div>{{end}}
<nav class="report-tools"><a href="/admin/reports">← Event reports</a><form method="get" action="/admin/reports/annual"><label>Year<input type="number" name="year" value="{{.Year}}" min="2020" max="2100"></label><label>Prepared for<select name="recipient"><option {{if eq .Recipient "NYDIG"}}selected{{end}}>NYDIG</option><option {{if eq .Recipient "HRF"}}selected{{end}}>HRF</option></select></label><button>Open annual draft</button></form>{{if not .Frozen}}<button type="button" id="report-edit">Edit report</button>{{end}}<button type="button" id="report-print">Print / Save as PDF</button></nav>
{{if .Message}}<p class="notice" role="status">{{.Message}}</p>{{end}}
{{if .Frozen}}<p class="notice">Frozen edition · {{.Frozen}}. Text and figures are preserved. <a href="{{.URL}}">Return to the live draft →</a></p>{{else}}
<details class="report-editor"><summary>Edit this {{.Recipient}} edition</summary><p><strong>Visual annual review with a dedicated cover and three event highlights per recap page.</strong> Aim for 150–200 words in the letter and 50–80 words in each other section. Longer copy can extend the printed document; no prose is silently cut. Bracketed draft prompts stay in this editor.</p><p>NYDIG and HRF have independent drafts. Save refreshes the charts. Freeze edition saves the text and collected figures together; future edits do not alter that edition. Export a PDF to preserve its visual appearance too.</p>
<form method="post" id="report-edit-form" data-save-label="Save annual draft"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{.CSRF}}"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="{{.Revision}}"><p id="report-save-status" role="status">Draft loaded.</p>
<fieldset><legend>Reporting scope</legend><p>Available registration, program, project, participant, winner and payout records are included automatically for selected completed events. Saved event recording analytics flow into this report without copying them manually.</p><button name="action" value="include_all" {{if .Preview}}disabled{{end}}>Save &amp; include all completed events</button><p>Sponsor pages emphasize annual totals. Every selected event contributes, including smaller events. Registration headlines start at 100; video-view headlines start at 1,000. Review individual event reports for source values.</p><label>Include events completed by<input type="date" name="cutoff" value="{{.Cutoff}}" required></label><p>The cutoff selects completed events by their local end date. Counts are current records collected when you save or freeze, not historical database values as of the cutoff. Change the cutoff and save to enable newly eligible events. Published upcoming events in the report year appear automatically on the cover and closing page; their metrics are not included yet.</p>
{{range .Events}}<article class="annual-event-editor"><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="event" value="{{.Event.ID}}" {{if .Included}}checked{{end}} {{if not .Eligible}}disabled{{end}}>{{.Event.Location}} · {{.Event.Period}}</label><p>{{.DataStatus}}</p>{{if .Included}}<p>{{if $.RegistrationBased}}{{.Registrations}} registrations{{else}}{{.Attendees}} recorded check-ins{{end}} · {{.Talks}} talks · {{.Workshops}} workshops · {{.Panels}} panels · {{.Projects}} projects</p>{{end}}<label>Hackathon coverage<select name="hack_{{.Event.ID}}"><option value="unknown" {{if or (eq .HackCoverage "unknown") (eq .HackCoverage "automatic")}}selected{{end}}>Automatically use available database records</option><option value="records" {{if eq .HackCoverage "records"}}selected{{end}}>Database records reviewed for this event</option><option value="none" {{if eq .HackCoverage "none"}}selected{{end}}>No hackathon at this event</option></select></label><a href="/{{.Event.Tag}}/admin/report">Review event report →</a></article>{{else}}<p>No published events with start dates in this year.</p>{{end}}
</fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Narrative · Markdown with live preview</legend>{{range .Sections}}<section class="narrative-editor"><label for="report-{{.Key}}">{{.Title}}</label><div class="narrative-columns"><textarea id="report-{{.Key}}" name="{{.Key}}" data-report-section="{{.Key}}" rows="10" maxlength="12000">{{.Text}}</textarea><div><div class="markdown-preview report-markdown" id="preview-{{.Key}}">{{.Markdown}}</div><p id="preview-status-{{.Key}}" class="preview-status" role="status">Preview up to date</p></div></div></section>{{end}}</fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Event highlights · Markdown with live preview</legend><p>Aim for 45–65 words per event. Completed events appear three per page; upcoming events appear in the closing section. Longer copy can extend the printed document.</p>{{range .EventHighlightEditors}}<section class="narrative-editor"><label for="report-{{.Copy.Key}}">{{.Event.Location}} · {{.Event.Title}}</label><div class="narrative-columns"><textarea id="report-{{.Copy.Key}}" name="{{.Copy.Key}}" data-report-section="{{.Copy.Key}}" rows="5" maxlength="2000">{{.Copy.Text}}</textarea><div><div class="markdown-preview report-markdown" id="preview-{{.Copy.Key}}">{{.Copy.Markdown}}</div><p id="preview-status-{{.Copy.Key}}" class="preview-status" role="status">Preview up to date</p></div></div></section>{{end}}</fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Annual online reach</legend><button type="button" id="annual-refresh-all" {{if .Preview}}disabled{{end}}>Save &amp; refresh analytics for all selected events</button><p>Saves your annual draft, refreshes each event’s linked X and YouTube recordings, then refreshes X post analytics once. Existing event text and attribution choices are preserved. Missing broadcast URLs and unreviewed hackathon records still need review.</p><div id="annual-refresh-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><details><summary>Review all matched recording counts</summary>{{range .AllMedia}}<p>{{.Event}} · {{.Platform}} · {{.Title}} · {{.Views}} views · {{.CollectionDate}}</p>{{end}}</details><p>Recording highlights are loaded from the selected event reports. Open an event report above and use “Save draft &amp; refresh recording views” to update its X and YouTube snapshot, then reload this annual draft. Frozen editions retain their saved figures and thumbnails.</p><p>Optional annual exports: include only the content covered by this report, explain the selection, and retain the source. Event-level exports remain in each event editor and are not automatically added together.</p>{{range .Platforms}}<h3>{{.Name}}</h3><div class="editor-grid">{{range .Metrics}}<label>{{.Label}}<input type="number" min="0" max="1000000000000" name="{{.Key}}" value="{{.Value}}" placeholder="Not supplied"></label>{{end}}<label>Source / account / export<input name="reach_{{.Key}}_source" value="{{.Source}}" maxlength="12000"></label><label>Reporting period<input name="reach_{{.Key}}_period" value="{{.Period}}" maxlength="12000"></label><label>Export date<input type="date" name="reach_{{.Key}}_date" value="{{.Date}}"></label><label>Content included / coverage<input name="reach_{{.Key}}_coverage" value="{{.Coverage}}" maxlength="12000"></label></div>{{end}}</fieldset>
<button name="action" value="save" {{if .Preview}}disabled{{end}}>Save annual draft</button> <button name="action" value="freeze" {{if .Preview}}disabled{{end}}>Save &amp; freeze edition</button>
</form>{{if .Editions}}<h3>Previously frozen editions</h3><ul>{{range .Editions}}<li><a href="{{.URL}}">{{.Date}}</a></li>{{end}}</ul>{{end}}</details>{{end}}
<main><div class="paper-edition annual-brief annual-impact">
<section class="paper-sheet impact-cover" aria-label="Annual report cover">
<header class="impact-cover-masthead"><span>bitcoin++</span><span>ANNUAL PARTNER REVIEW</span></header>
<p class="impact-cover-year">{{.Year}}</p>
<h1>A year of<br><em>building Bitcoin.</em></h1>
<p class="impact-cover-deck">The people, places, and technical work shaping the year.</p>
<div class="impact-cover-events">{{range .CoverEvents}}<figure>{{if .Event.LeadImage}}<img src="{{.Event.LeadImage}}" alt="{{.Event.Location}} event landing artwork">{{end}}<figcaption><strong>{{.Event.Location}}</strong>{{if .Status}}<span>{{.Status}}</span>{{end}}</figcaption></figure>{{end}}</div>
<div class="impact-cover-recipient"><span>PREPARED FOR</span>{{if .RecipientLogo}}<img class="annual-recipient-logo" src="{{.RecipientLogo}}" alt="{{.Recipient}}">{{else}}<strong>{{.Recipient}}</strong>{{end}}</div>
<footer class="impact-cover-footer"><span>Completed events through {{.Cutoff}}</span><span>bitcoin++ / {{.Year}}</span></footer>
</section>

<section class="paper-sheet brief-opening">
<header class="paper-running"><span>bitcoin++ / {{.Year}}</span><span>Prepared for {{.Recipient}} · {{.ReportFolio 2}}</span></header>
<h1>A note<br><em>from nifty.</em></h1>
<div class="impact-opening-art" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
<div data-section="note"><div class="story-text report-markdown">{{(.BriefSection "note").Markdown}}</div></div>
<p class="paper-source">Selected completed events through {{.Cutoff}} · Prepared for {{.Recipient}}.</p>
<footer class="paper-folio"><span>With thanks to {{.Recipient}}</span><span>People · ideas · working code</span></footer>
</section>

{{range .EventHighlightPages}}<section class="paper-sheet annual-event-recaps" aria-label="Event highlights"><div class="paper-running"><span></span><span>{{.Folio}}</span></div><div class="annual-recap-list">{{range .Highlights}}<article class="annual-event-recap">{{if .Event.LeadImage}}<img src="{{.Event.LeadImage}}" alt="{{.Event.Location}} event artwork">{{end}}<div><h2>{{.Event.Location}}</h2><p class="annual-recap-edition">{{.Edition}}</p><p class="annual-recap-date">{{.Event.Period}}</p><div data-section="{{.Copy.Key}}"><div class="story-text report-markdown">{{.Copy.Markdown}}</div></div><dl class="annual-recap-stats" aria-label="Event statistics">{{range .Stats}}<div class="annual-recap-stat annual-recap-stat--{{.Kind}}" title="{{.Detail}}"><dd>{{.Value}}</dd><dt>{{.Label}}</dt></div>{{end}}</dl><a class="annual-recap-link" href="{{.FeatureURL}}">{{.Feature}} ↗</a></div></article>{{end}}</div><footer class="paper-folio"><span>bitcoin++ / {{$.Year}}</span><span>People · places · ideas</span></footer></section>{{end}}

<section class="paper-sheet impact-community">
<div class="paper-running"><span></span><span>{{.ReportFolio 3}}</span></div>
<h2>Many gatherings.<br><em>A shared direction.</em></h2>
<div class="report-topline-grid">{{if .ShowParticipation}}<article><div class="report-topline-circle"><strong>{{.ParticipationTotal}}</strong><span>{{if .RegistrationBased}}registrations{{else}}event attendances{{end}}</span></div></article>{{end}}{{with .UniquePeopleHeadline}}<article><div class="report-topline-circle"><strong>{{.}}</strong><span>{{if $.RegistrationBased}}unique registered people{{else}}unique checked-in people{{end}}</span></div></article>{{end}}</div>
<svg viewBox="0 0 720 350" class="annual-globe" role="img" aria-label="Included event locations"><image href="/static/img/report-globes.svg" width="720" height="350"/>{{range .MapPoints}}<circle cx="{{.X}}" cy="{{.Y}}" r="7" fill="#f7b500" stroke="#513762" stroke-width="2"><title>{{.Name}}</title></circle>{{end}}</svg>
<div class="impact-places"><strong>{{len .Included}} gatherings</strong>{{range .Included}}<a href="https://btcpp.dev/{{.Event.Tag}}">{{.Event.Location}} ↗</a>{{end}}</div>
<div data-section="community"><div class="story-text report-markdown">{{(.BriefSection "community").Markdown}}</div></div>
<footer class="paper-folio"><span>bitcoin++ / {{.Year}}</span><span>A global gathering of builders</span></footer>
</section>

<section class="paper-sheet impact-program">
<div class="paper-running"><span></span><span>{{.ReportFolio 4}}</span></div>
<h2>Technical depth.<br><em>Different perspectives.</em></h2>
<div class="impact-program-grid"><div class="impact-program-donut">{{template "annual_donut" .ProgramChart}}</div><div class="impact-speakers"><strong>{{.UniqueSpeakers}}</strong><span>distinct program speakers</span><div data-section="program"><div class="story-text report-markdown">{{(.BriefSection "program").Markdown}}</div></div></div></div>
{{with .StageDemand}}{{template "report_stage_demand" .}}{{end}}
<h3>What each gathering made room for</h3><div class="impact-program-bars">{{range .ProgramRows}}<div class="annual-bar-row"><div><span>{{.Name}}</span><strong>{{.Count}} sessions</strong></div><div class="annual-stack"><i style="width:{{.TalkWidth}}%;background:#c8b3f5"></i><i style="width:{{.WorkshopWidth}}%;background:#f7b500"></i><i style="width:{{.PanelWidth}}%;background:#f6b9dc"></i></div></div>{{end}}</div>
<footer class="paper-folio"><span>bitcoin++ / {{.Year}}</span><span>Learning from one another</span></footer>
</section>

<section class="paper-sheet impact-reach">
<div class="paper-running"><span></span><span>{{.ReportFolio 5}}</span></div>
<h2>The event ends.<br><em>The ideas keep moving.</em></h2>
<div class="impact-reach-heroes">{{range .MediaTotals}}<article><strong>{{.Display}}</strong><span>{{.Platform}} recording views</span><p class="paper-source">{{.Recordings}} matched recordings · {{.FirstCollected}}{{if ne .FirstCollected .LastCollected}} – {{.LastCollected}}{{end}}</p></article>{{end}}
{{range .HeadlinePlatforms}}{{$platform := .Name}}{{range .HeadlineMetrics}}<article><strong>{{.Display}}</strong><span>{{$platform}} {{.Label}}</span></article>{{end}}{{end}}</div>
<div class="brief-recordings">{{range .BriefMedia}}<article><a href="{{.URL}}">{{if .ImageURL}}<img src="{{.ImageURL}}" alt="{{.Title}} recording thumbnail">{{end}}<h3>{{.Title}}</h3></a><p class="report-card-detail">{{.Event}} · {{.Platform}}</p><a href="{{.URL}}">Watch the recording ↗</a>{{if .MomentURL}} · <a href="{{.MomentURL}}">Selected moment ↗</a>{{end}}</article>{{end}}</div>
{{with .TopPost}}<div class="annual-post-highlight"><p>{{.Excerpt}}</p><a href="{{.URL}}">Read on X ↗</a></div>{{end}}
<div data-section="reach"><div class="story-text report-markdown">{{(.BriefSection "reach").Markdown}}</div></div>
<footer class="paper-folio"><span>bitcoin++ / {{.Year}}</span><span>Watch · discuss · share</span></footer>
</section>

<section class="paper-sheet impact-funding">
<div class="paper-running"><span></span><span>{{.ReportFolio 6}}</span></div>
<h2>Support that reaches<br><em>the builders.</em></h2>
<div class="annual-funding-overview">{{with .FundingChart}}{{if .Rows}}<div class="impact-funding-chart">{{template "annual_funding_donut" .}}</div>{{end}}{{end}}
<div class="brief-build-stats">{{range .BuildingMetrics}}<article><strong>{{.Value}}</strong><span>{{.Label}}</span></article>{{end}}</div>
</div><div class="annual-funding-events">{{range .Included}}{{if and .HackKnown (gt .Sats 0)}}<article>{{if .Event.LeadImage}}<img src="{{.Event.LeadImage}}" alt="{{.Event.Location}} event artwork">{{end}}<div><h3>{{.Event.Location}}</h3><p class="annual-funding-award"><strong>{{.SatsDisplay}}</strong> sats distributed</p><p class="annual-funding-projects"><strong>{{.Projects}}</strong> submitted projects</p><a href="https://btcpp.dev/{{.Event.Tag}}/hackathon">Explore the hackathon ↗</a></div></article>{{end}}{{end}}</div>
<div data-section="building"><div class="story-text report-markdown">{{(.BriefSection "building").Markdown}}</div></div>
<footer class="paper-folio"><span>bitcoin++ / {{.Year}}</span><span>Resources for working prototypes</span></footer>
</section>

<section class="paper-sheet impact-winners">
<div class="paper-running"><span></span><span>{{.ReportFolio 7}}</span></div>
<h2>Meet the work.<br><em>Follow the builders.</em></h2>
<div class="impact-winner-gallery">{{range .BriefProjects}}<article><div class="impact-winner-visuals">{{if .Project.Image}}<figure><img src="{{.Project.Image}}" alt="{{.Project.Title}} project artwork"><figcaption>Project artwork</figcaption></figure>{{end}}{{template "report_winner_team" .Project}}</div><div><h3>{{.Project.Title}}</h3><p class="report-card-detail">{{.Event}} · {{.Project.Awards}}</p>{{with .Project.PrizeFigure}}<p class="report-prize-amount"><strong>{{.Value}}</strong> {{.Label}}</p>{{end}}<p>{{.Project.ShortDescription}}</p><a href="https://btcpp.dev/{{.Tag}}/hackathon/projects/{{.Project.PublicID}}">Explore the project ↗</a>{{if .Project.GitHub}} · <a href="{{.Project.GitHub}}">Code ↗</a>{{end}}</div></article>{{else}}<p>Winner highlights will appear once event results and coverage have been reviewed.</p>{{end}}</div>
<p class="paper-source">Selected projects have finalized awards. Awarded amounts and recorded payouts are labeled separately. Project artwork and available member profile images are not event-action photography. A prototype is a starting point, not evidence of adoption.</p>
<footer class="paper-folio"><span>bitcoin++ / {{.Year}}</span><span>Explore what they built</span></footer>
</section>

<section class="paper-sheet brief-closing">
<div class="paper-running"><span></span><span>{{.ReportFolio 8}}</span></div>
<h2>Keep opening<br><em>new doors.</em></h2>
<div class="brief-closing-copy"><div>{{if (.BriefSection "lessons").Text}}<h3>What we learned</h3>{{end}}<div data-section="lessons"><div class="story-text report-markdown">{{(.BriefSection "lessons").Markdown}}</div></div></div><div>{{if (.BriefSection "next").Text}}<h3>What comes next</h3>{{end}}<div data-section="next"><div class="story-text report-markdown">{{(.BriefSection "next").Markdown}}</div></div></div></div>
{{if .Forthcoming}}<div class="annual-forthcoming">{{range .UpcomingHighlights}}<article>{{if .Event.LeadImage}}<img src="{{.Event.LeadImage}}" alt="{{.Event.Location}} event landing artwork">{{end}}<div><h3>{{.Event.Location}}</h3><p class="report-card-detail">Still ahead in {{$.Year}} · {{.Status}}</p><p>{{.Event.Title}}<br>{{.Event.Period}}</p><div data-section="{{.Copy.Key}}"><div class="story-text report-markdown">{{.Copy.Markdown}}</div></div><a href="https://btcpp.dev/{{.Event.Tag}}">Explore the event ↗</a></div></article>{{end}}</div><p class="paper-source">Upcoming events are part of this year's story; their registrations, programs, views, and hackathon results are excluded from completed-event totals.</p>{{else}}<div class="impact-opening-art closing-art" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>{{end}}
<p class="brief-thanks">Thank you, {{.Recipient}}, for backing the people building Bitcoin.</p>
<p class="paper-source">Metrics cover selected completed events starting in {{.Year}}, through {{.Cutoff}}; upcoming events are shown editorially. Records collected {{.Generated}}; this is not a historical reconstruction as of the cutoff. {{if .Frozen}}Text and figures are frozen in this edition.{{else}}This is a live editorial draft.{{end}} These gatherings offer a window into the developer community, not a census.</p>
<footer class="paper-folio"><span>bitcoin++ / {{.Year}}</span><span>With gratitude · nifty</span></footer>
</section>
</div></main></body></html>
{{define "annual_funding_donut"}}<svg viewBox="0 0 160 160" role="img" aria-label="{{.CompactTotal}} sats recorded sent or claimed; event breakdown below"><circle cx="80" cy="80" r="60" fill="none" stroke="#e1dae6" stroke-width="18"/>{{range .Donut}}<circle cx="80" cy="80" r="60" fill="none" stroke="{{.Color}}" stroke-width="18" pathLength="100" stroke-dasharray="{{.Percent}} 100" stroke-dashoffset="{{.Offset}}" transform="rotate(-90 80 80)"/>{{end}}<text x="80" y="80" text-anchor="middle" class="funding-total">{{.CompactTotal}}</text><text x="80" y="94" text-anchor="middle" class="funding-unit">sats sent / claimed</text></svg>{{end}}
{{define "annual_bars"}}<div class="annual-bars">{{range .Rows}}<div class="annual-bar-row"><div><span>{{.Label}}</span><strong>{{.Value}}</strong></div><div class="annual-bar-track"><i style="width:{{.Width}}%"></i></div></div>{{else}}<p>No reviewed event data in this selection.</p>{{end}}</div>{{end}}
{{define "annual_donut"}}{{if .Donut}}<svg class="annual-donut" viewBox="0 0 120 120" role="img" aria-label="Distribution; values listed below"><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="44" fill="none" stroke="#e1dae6" stroke-width="15"/>{{range .Donut}}<circle cx="60" cy="60" r="44" fill="none" stroke="{{.Color}}" stroke-width="15" pathLength="100" stroke-dasharray="{{.Percent}} 100" stroke-dashoffset="{{.Offset}}" transform="rotate(-90 60 60)"/>{{end}}<text x="60" y="65" text-anchor="middle">{{.DonutTotal}}</text></svg><ul class="annual-legend">{{range .Donut}}<li><i style="background:{{.Color}}"></i><span>{{.Label}}</span><strong>{{.Value}}</strong></li>{{end}}</ul>{{else}}<p>No recorded entries in this selection.</p>{{end}}{{end}}
